## ObjectType: Material

An inventory item whose live stock is compared with its safety stock.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| sku | SKU | string | Unique material code | sku |
| name | Name | string | Material display name | name |
| current_stock | Current Stock | integer | Current available quantity | current_stock |
| safety_stock | Safety Stock | integer | Replenishment threshold | safety_stock |
| supplier_id | Supplier ID | string | Foreign key to supplier | supplier_id |
| unit_cost | Unit Cost | number | Cost of one item | unit_cost |

### Keys

Primary Keys: sku
Display Key: name
